WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:06.530
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.660 --> 00:10.110
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.110 --> 00:12.060
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.650
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.500 --> 00:20.180
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.080 --> 00:33.510
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.080 --> 00:33.510
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

00:36.470 --> 00:41.220
<i>The callous absurdity I've 
carried with me since birth</i>

00:41.220 --> 00:46.900
<i>meant playing shadow tag to find my next meal</i>

00:47.440 --> 00:50.650
<i>Bit by bit, my heart got bent out of shape</i>

00:50.650 --> 00:53.650
<i>until I tuned out both 
the cheers and the jeers</i>

00:55.860 --> 01:00.530
<i>That's how I survived my initial loneliness</i>

01:00.530 --> 01:05.540
<i>Night falls and the darkness grows</i>

01:05.960 --> 01:10.750
<i>blending in, coalescing</i>

01:11.090 --> 01:15.510
<i>around so trivial a fate as my own</i>

01:15.510 --> 01:18.340
<i>Hey, I want to get through to you</i>

01:18.340 --> 01:22.390
<i>though I may only know commonplace words</i>

01:23.890 --> 01:26.690
<i>It's so frustrating having to be like this</i>

01:26.690 --> 01:29.610
<i>Hey, never mind that it may not be easy</i>

01:29.610 --> 01:34.030
<i>to become angry or let yourself cry</i>

01:35.150 --> 01:38.740
<i>because someone could be listening in</i>

01:38.740 --> 01:41.950
<i>The only thing that's 
certain is the temperature</i>

01:44.200 --> 01:49.120
<i>whether or not we can speak heart to heart</i>

01:50.830 --> 01:55.010
<b>Miranjo and the Demon</b>

01:52.710 --> 01:56.900
<i>The Houma Kingdom was a rich 
land surrounded by nature.</i>

01:57.920 --> 02:02.630
<i>Miranjo was a kindhearted child,
 full of curiosity,</i>

02:03.070 --> 02:06.150
<i>whose parents were both 
outstanding magic users.</i>

02:07.260 --> 02:09.980
Hmm? Come on over.

02:24.280 --> 02:26.200
That looks like a puppy!

02:36.810 --> 02:38.670
What's the matter?

02:54.870 --> 02:56.200
What's that you're eating?

03:00.830 --> 03:04.230
I'm Miranjo. Who are you?

03:05.070 --> 03:07.610
Ah! Wait up!

03:13.380 --> 03:16.810
Oh! Wow, how pretty!

03:36.460 --> 03:38.010
There, that's better...

03:42.050 --> 03:43.320
Bye, now.

03:43.930 --> 03:45.320
Ah, there you are!

03:45.320 --> 03:47.110
Wait for me!

03:52.410 --> 03:53.240
Huh?

03:54.580 --> 03:56.360
He disappeared.

03:57.640 --> 04:00.870
Fine, then! I'm going home! Hmph!

04:21.570 --> 04:22.410
Huh?

05:15.800 --> 05:18.330
I don't know how to get back.

05:20.370 --> 05:21.330
Hey...

05:32.980 --> 05:34.410
Wait up!

05:43.690 --> 05:47.670
All right. I'll pay whatever you want.

06:28.330 --> 06:31.310
I want to go home.

06:44.560 --> 06:47.530
Can I get home?

06:51.260 --> 06:52.130
Mm-hmm.

07:06.520 --> 07:09.520
I've seen this place before. Ah!

07:10.730 --> 07:12.000
The puppy rock!

07:21.440 --> 07:23.340
That's my home over there!

07:23.950 --> 07:25.070
Come on!

07:25.070 --> 07:25.580
Mm-hmm.

07:36.930 --> 07:38.410
Hey!

07:39.010 --> 07:40.410
Aren't you coming?

07:43.710 --> 07:45.440
I'll come visit again!

07:59.870 --> 08:04.880
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

08:05.920 --> 08:10.880
<b>The Prince and His Treasures</b>

08:11.560 --> 08:14.240
<i>After prevailing in the battle 
with Ouken and Bosse,</i>

08:14.240 --> 08:16.000
<i>Bojji had succeeded to the throne,</i>

08:16.350 --> 08:19.390
<i>but his good friend Kage had disappeared.</i>

08:20.260 --> 08:22.540
<i>Relinquishing the throne 
to his brother, Daida,</i>

08:22.540 --> 08:25.460
<i>Bojji resolved to go after Kage.</i>

08:25.460 --> 08:29.310
<i>And now, the day when he was to 
depart the castle had arrived.</i>

08:59.090 --> 09:01.270
Prince Bojji, please excuse me.

09:01.810 --> 09:03.830
Are you ready to go?

09:10.040 --> 09:12.700
You want to give everyone something?

09:12.700 --> 09:17.620
Very well. But please... see that
 you finish before midday.

09:17.620 --> 09:20.900
I would like to get as far as we can today.

09:28.730 --> 09:33.050
Hold on, is this a molt from Mitsumata?

09:48.160 --> 09:50.080
Thank you very much.

09:57.010 --> 09:58.340
Prince Bojji?

10:01.600 --> 10:04.110
Oh-ho! What are you going to give us?

10:07.990 --> 10:09.670
What are these?

10:15.520 --> 10:19.710
These are your treasures, and you hope 
they will be good luck charms for us?

10:21.200 --> 10:23.620
Oh, thank you so much.

10:26.000 --> 10:29.360
I think I'll put mine on 
display in the study.

10:29.360 --> 10:32.790
Ho ho! It's kind of charming, isn't it?

10:46.790 --> 10:48.040
Prince Bojji!

10:50.440 --> 10:51.920
What do you need?

10:53.340 --> 10:55.090
Something for me?

11:00.550 --> 11:04.500
Ah, I see. It does look like 
a spearhead, doesn't it?

11:08.190 --> 11:10.020
Yes, I certainly will.

11:18.100 --> 11:22.300
It is my duty to keep everyone safe.
 Please don't worry.

11:26.790 --> 11:28.090
Prince Bojji is here?

11:32.890 --> 11:34.110
Prince Bojji!

11:36.260 --> 11:37.920
Gifts for everyone?

11:42.300 --> 11:43.610
Isn't that...?

11:48.850 --> 11:50.710
That brings back memories.

11:59.250 --> 12:01.750
Please have a wonderful journey.

12:10.010 --> 12:12.320
Not good enough! Fight like 
your life depends on it!

12:15.060 --> 12:18.800
Prince Bojji! Are you all finished 
packing for your journey?

12:23.920 --> 12:25.810
Something you want to give us?

12:32.330 --> 12:34.120
Thank you very much.

12:36.960 --> 12:39.110
M-Master Domas?

13:10.800 --> 13:13.080
Are you absolutely sure about this?

13:13.080 --> 13:15.640
I know you've been treasuring 
these for a long time.

13:20.950 --> 13:23.740
You're giving them to us <i>because</i>
they're your treasures?

13:24.610 --> 13:26.630
Prince Bojji!

13:27.960 --> 13:30.420
They must be very important to you.

13:31.580 --> 13:37.510
I vow on this treasure that 
as Swordmaster, I will protect everyone!

13:42.310 --> 13:44.380
You there! Your uniform is disheveled!

13:44.760 --> 13:46.260
Off with your head!

13:46.260 --> 13:48.340
Master Dorshe has returned!

13:50.860 --> 13:55.040
Good training session, everyone. 
Tomorrow will be even harder.

13:59.390 --> 14:02.150
Queen Hiling, I have returned.

14:02.150 --> 14:03.520
Nice work.

14:03.520 --> 14:05.230
Oh? What's that?

14:06.390 --> 14:08.270
I got it from Bojji.

14:08.270 --> 14:09.660
Pretty, isn't it?

14:10.060 --> 14:11.640
Is that right?

14:12.580 --> 14:15.130
I got <i>this</i> from him.

14:15.530 --> 14:16.950
Is that a fang?

14:16.950 --> 14:19.940
Apparently, it is one of 
Prince Bojji's precious treasures.

14:20.390 --> 14:23.430
He told me not to worry about the kingdom.

14:23.430 --> 14:24.780
I assured him...

14:25.680 --> 14:29.760
that I would see to it that 
Queen Hiling was kept...

14:30.350 --> 14:31.370
safe.

14:37.760 --> 14:41.100
Brother, are you all ready 
to go on your journey?

14:44.740 --> 14:46.220
Something to give me?

14:49.420 --> 14:50.600
What is it?

14:52.200 --> 14:53.210
An acorn?

15:06.490 --> 15:13.050
A good luck charm? I'm not a 
child anymore. Still, thank you very much.

15:13.740 --> 15:16.600
How about we plant this here in the castle?

15:17.000 --> 15:19.010
It might grow up to be a great tree.

15:20.730 --> 15:24.520
Someday, when you get back, 
I'm sure you'll be surprised.

15:26.100 --> 15:28.260
It's time for you to be off, isn't it?

15:35.180 --> 15:38.850
You still have to go see Miranjo 
and visit Father's gravesite?

15:41.450 --> 15:42.470
Miranjo?

15:42.830 --> 15:45.840
I don't know. She was 
here a little while ago.

15:46.680 --> 15:49.480
Brother, there's something 
I need to tell you—

15:50.120 --> 15:51.210
Brother!

17:29.510 --> 17:30.860
Prince Bojji...

17:37.480 --> 17:39.020
For me?

17:41.360 --> 17:42.600
It's pretty.

17:50.480 --> 17:55.840
Yes, I will always remain 
at King Daida's side.

18:00.020 --> 18:03.840
Prince Bojji, can I ask 
you to deliver a message?

18:35.410 --> 18:38.810
Brother, I wanted to tell 
you something earlier.

18:39.900 --> 18:42.900
I will be a great king.

18:43.940 --> 18:45.830
One as good as you have been.

18:46.450 --> 18:49.440
So please leave the dealings 
of the kingdom to me.

18:51.350 --> 18:56.280
<i>Face dewy with tears and sweat</i>

18:56.280 --> 18:59.850
<i>With your own unique beauty</i>

18:59.850 --> 19:02.770
<i>Smile for me</i>

19:02.770 --> 19:09.290
<i>Panting with exertion,
you shine brighter than anyone</i>

19:04.570 --> 19:05.850
Be careful out there.

19:17.550 --> 19:21.050
<i>You melted into these almost listless days</i>

19:21.370 --> 19:26.140
<i>Energy faded like soda gone flat</i>

19:24.570 --> 19:26.140
Awesome, isn't it?

19:26.140 --> 19:30.250
<i>As a duckling you spread your wings</i>

19:27.070 --> 19:29.640
We're traveling all over the land,

19:29.640 --> 19:33.860
so we're gonna see all kinds of awesome 
sights like this from here on.

19:30.250 --> 19:34.900
<i>And dream of flying as a swan</i>

19:34.900 --> 19:39.300
<i>If you have to wander, 
then enjoy it as much as you can</i>

19:39.300 --> 19:43.750
<i>Nothing fun about just
taking shortcuts, right?</i>

19:43.750 --> 19:46.280
<i>You took your time, took the hard road</i>

19:45.140 --> 19:45.870
Hmm?

19:46.280 --> 19:48.720
<i>But you couldn't get there</i>

19:48.720 --> 19:52.750
<i>You keep chasing the sunset
as many times as it takes</i>

19:49.630 --> 19:52.240
A sword, huh? Okay, my turn.

19:54.070 --> 19:55.660
That one's a spear.

19:54.220 --> 19:57.570
<i>Now run far</i>

19:57.570 --> 20:06.260
<i>Your dirty shoes and footprints
will head steadily into the future</i>

20:02.280 --> 20:03.680
Oh, over there!

20:06.260 --> 20:14.170
<i>Panting with exertion,
you shine brighter than anyone</i>

20:12.160 --> 20:14.980
A message from Miranjo? For me?

20:16.290 --> 20:19.710
I want you to tell him, "Thank you."

20:20.490 --> 20:24.030
He offered his thanks by 
the side of the river...

20:25.190 --> 20:26.330
and at that moment,

20:27.120 --> 20:29.540
I did indeed feel as though I'd been saved.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.560
Hmm...

20:34.780 --> 20:37.750
I guess it's possible that she 
was on her own for a long time,

20:37.750 --> 20:39.770
and felt lonesome.

20:42.600 --> 20:45.470
Bojji, I'm always...

20:45.830 --> 20:47.620
gonna be in your corner.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.480
Please make sure...

20:52.480 --> 20:55.090
to always stay with him, okay?

21:19.880 --> 21:31.890
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>

21:35.190 --> 21:40.900
<i>The nights when I was alone 
still had countless stars</i>

21:40.900 --> 21:46.030
<i>Even now, they're close at 
hand whenever I close my eyes</i>

21:46.530 --> 21:49.530
<i>With no destination, I kept on walking</i>

21:49.530 --> 21:52.370
<i>Although I was tired, I kept on walking</i>

21:52.370 --> 21:58.040
<i>I just wanted to remain in prayers forever</i>

21:58.040 --> 22:00.960
<i>Covered in scars, covered in mud</i>

22:00.960 --> 22:03.760
<i>stretching out hands that won't reach</i>

22:03.760 --> 22:13.560
<i>I want to seize a fragment of my 
hopes and dreams right this minute</i>

22:13.970 --> 22:19.730
<i>Keep smiling, keep smiling, 
you don't have to be strong</i>

22:19.730 --> 22:27.150
<i>That sweet smile, that 
sweet smile is all you need</i>

22:27.150 --> 22:31.740
<i>Your unique smile brings 
the power and strength</i>

22:31.740 --> 22:38.210
<i>to chase away all the clouds</i>

22:38.210 --> 22:48.550
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>
